    /* ---------- vi: characters (official English restored where known) ---------- */
    "vi.vi-jason-duval.role": "Protagonist",
    "vi.vi-jason-duval.tagline": "Jason wants an easy life, but things just keep getting harder.",
    "vi.vi-jason-duval.desc": "Jason grew up around grifters and crooks. After a stint in the Army trying to shake off his troubled teens, he found himself in the Keys doing what he knows best, working for local drug runners. It might be time to try something new — and meeting Lucia could be the best or worst thing to ever happen to him.",
    "vi.vi-jason-duval.quote": "If anything happens, I'm right behind you.",
    "vi.vi-jason-duval.quoteSource": "Trailer 2",
    "vi.vi-lucia-caminos.role": "Protagonist",
    "vi.vi-lucia-caminos.tagline": "Lucia's father taught her to fight as soon as she could walk.",
    "vi.vi-lucia-caminos.desc": "Life has been coming at her swinging ever since. Fighting for her family landed her in the Leonida Penitentiary; sheer luck got her out. Lucia has learned her lesson — only smart moves from here. She wants the good life, and she's ready to risk it all with Jason to get it.",
    "vi.vi-lucia-caminos.quote": "The only thing that matters these days is who you know and what you got.",
    "vi.vi-lucia-caminos.quoteSource": "Trailer 1",
    "vi.vi-cal-hampton.role": "Jason's friend · radio lookout",
    "vi.vi-cal-hampton.tagline": "What if everything on the internet was true?",
    "vi.vi-cal-hampton.desc": "A friend of Jason's and a fellow associate of Brian's, Cal feels safest at home, snooping on Coast Guard comms with a few beers and several anonymous browser tabs open. He lives at America's low tide — and he's happy there. Casual paranoia loves company, but Jason has bigger plans.",
    "vi.vi-cal-hampton.quote": "The psychopaths are in charge. Get used to it.",
    "vi.vi-cal-hampton.quoteSource": "Official site",
    "vi.vi-boobie-ike.role": "Vice City legend · entertainment empire",
    "vi.vi-boobie-ike.tagline": "A local Vice City legend — and he acts like it.",
    "vi.vi-boobie-ike.desc": "Boobie is one of the few who turned his years in the streets into a legitimate empire: real estate, a strip club and a recording studio. He may look like he only thinks about himself, but the partnership with young Dre'Quan at Only Raw Records is the bet he believes in most.",
    "vi.vi-boobie-ike.quote": "I'm all smiles — right up until it's time to talk business.",
    "vi.vi-boobie-ike.quoteSource": "Official site (adapted)",
    "vi.vi-drequan-priest.role": "Rising producer · Only Raw Records",
    "vi.vi-drequan-priest.tagline": "Always more hustler than gangster.",
    "vi.vi-drequan-priest.desc": "Even back when he was selling on the streets to get by, Dre'Quan's goal was always the music. Now that he's signed the Real Dimez, his days booking shows at Boobie's club may be numbered — his sights are set on the entire Vice City scene.",
    "vi.vi-drequan-priest.quote": "The music was always the goal. Everything else was just a way to get there.",
    "vi.vi-drequan-priest.quoteSource": "Official site (adapted)",
    "vi.vi-real-dimez.role": "Rap duo and social media royalty · Bae-Luxe and Roxy",
    "vi.vi-real-dimez.tagline": "Friends since high school — and partners in the hustle from day one.",
    "vi.vi-real-dimez.desc": "Bae-Luxe and Roxy had the savvy to turn their days shaking down local dealers into cold hard cash, with provocative tracks and a relentless social media presence. A hit with local rapper DWNPLY took them to another level; five years and plenty of drama later, they signed with Only Raw Records hoping lightning strikes twice.",
    "vi.vi-real-dimez.quote": "From the hustle to the tracks, from the tracks to cold hard cash.",
    "vi.vi-real-dimez.quoteSource": "Official site (adapted)",
    "vi.vi-raul-bautista.role": "Veteran bank robber",
    "vi.vi-raul-bautista.tagline": "Experience counts.",
    "vi.vi-raul-bautista.desc": "Confidence, charm and cunning: Raul is a seasoned bank robber, always scouting for talent willing to take the risks that bring the biggest rewards. To him, a heist is like a good meal — every ingredient has to be in place before you start cooking.",
    "vi.vi-raul-bautista.quote": "Life is full of surprises, my friend. We would do well to remember that.",
    "vi.vi-raul-bautista.quoteSource": "Official site",
    "vi.vi-brian-heder.role": "Old-guard smuggler of the Keys",
    "vi.vi-brian-heder.tagline": "Looks like a Leonida beach bum, moves like a great white shark.",
    "vi.vi-brian-heder.desc": "Brian is a classic drug runner from the golden age of smuggling in the Keys. He still moves product through his boatyard alongside Lori, his third wife, and has been in the game long enough to leave the dirty work to others. He lets Jason live rent-free on one of his properties — as long as he helps with local collections and shows up now and then for Lori's sangria.",
    "vi.vi-brian-heder.quote": "I've been at this far too long to get my own hands dirty.",
    "vi.vi-brian-heder.quoteSource": "Official site (adapted)",

    /* ---------- vi: places ---------- */
    "vi.vi-leonida.tagline": "Only in Leonida.",
    "vi.vi-leonida.desc": "Rockstar's take on Florida: an entire state of neon, swamp, sugar mills and tourist-trap ruin, where Vice City is only the beginning. Six regions confirmed by the official site make up the biggest, most immersive world in the series to date.",
    "vi.vi-leonida.vibe": "Sun, sweat and bad decisions",
    "vi.vi-vice-city.tagline": "The dark side of the sunniest place in America.",
    "vi.vi-vice-city.desc": "The neon-drenched metropolis is still the capital of sun and fun — America's glamour, hustle and greed captured in a single city. Fortunes are made and lost between the shoreline, the condos and the nightlife's back rooms.",
    "vi.vi-vice-city.vibe": "Neon, money and facades too pretty to be true",
    "vi.vi-leonida-keys.tagline": "The dress code is casual and the bars are always fully stocked.",
    "vi.vi-leonida-keys.desc": "Life on this tropical archipelago isn't fancy, but it is easy. Grab your drink and stretch out on your beach chair — just stay sharp: you're on the doorstep of some of the most beautiful and dangerous waters in all of America.",
    "vi.vi-leonida-keys.vibe": "Flip-flops, live bait and smuggling at sunset",
    "vi.vi-grassrivers.tagline": "The untamable jewel in Leonida's crown.",
    "vi.vi-grassrivers.desc": "You never know what lies beneath the surface of this primordial expanse. The gators may be the most famous attraction, but there are far deadlier predators — and far stranger discoveries — out among the mangroves.",
    "vi.vi-grassrivers.vibe": "Airboats, gators and swamp secrets",
    "vi.vi-port-gellhorn.tagline": "Leonida's forgotten coast.",
    "vi.vi-port-gellhorn.desc": "Cheap motels, shuttered attractions and empty strip malls won't bring the tourists back, but there's a new economy in this former vacation destination — powered by strong beer, painkillers and gas-station energy drinks.",
    "vi.vi-port-gellhorn.vibe": "Faded glory and crooked fresh starts",
    "vi.vi-ambrosia.tagline": "American industry and old-fashioned values — whatever the cost.",
    "vi.vi-ambrosia.desc": "In the heart of Leonida, the Allied Crystal sugar refinery keeps the jobs coming, while the local motorcycle club supplies just about everything else. A town of smokestacks, dust and old loyalties.",
    "vi.vi-ambrosia.vibe": "Refinery smoke, motorcycle clubs and sweat",
    "vi.vi-mount-kalaga.tagline": "Breathing room on the state's northern border.",
    "vi.vi-mount-kalaga.desc": "A national landmark leaning against Leonida's northern state line, Mount Kalaga offers first-rate hunting, fishing and off-road trails. In the thick woods around it, hillbilly mystics and paranoid radicals live far from the government's gaze.",
    "vi.vi-mount-kalaga.vibe": "Trails, hunting and people who don't want to be found",

