    "vi.vi-fact-release.text": "Launching November 19, 2026 (a Thursday) for PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X|S, after two official delays.",
    "vi.vi-fact-duo.text": "Two playable protagonists — Jason Duval and Lucia Caminos — caught up in a conspiracy stretching across the state after an easy score goes wrong.",
    "vi.vi-fact-map.text": "Set in the state of Leonida: Vice City plus five named regions (Leonida Keys, Grassrivers, Port Gellhorn, Ambrosia and Mount Kalaga).",
