    "vi.vi-fact-universe.text": "GTA VI belongs to the HD Universe (the same as GTA IV and GTA V), with a standalone story — no need to play the earlier games.",
    "vi.vi-fact-site.text": "The official site features eight character groups — from Cal Hampton and Boobie Ike to Raul Bautista and Brian Heder — each with their own web of interests.",
    "vi.vi-rumor-pc.text": "PC version: not announced. The track record of GTA V and Red Dead Redemption 2 suggests it arrives after the consoles — community expectation, not confirmation.",
    "vi.vi-rumor-trailer3.text": "Trailer 3: press projections point to late July or August 2026, fueled by updates to the official site. Rockstar has announced nothing.",
