    /* ---------- vi: FAQ ---------- */
    "vi.vi-faq-date.q": "When does GTA VI launch?",
    "vi.vi-faq-date.a": "On November 19, 2026 — a Thursday. Rockstar confirmed the date in November 2025, after two delays (the original window was 2025, then May 26, 2026).",
    "vi.vi-faq-platforms.q": "Which platforms is it coming to?",
    "vi.vi-faq-platforms.a": "At launch, PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X|S only. No other platform has been announced.",
    "vi.vi-faq-pc.q": "Will there be a PC version?",
    "vi.vi-faq-pc.a": "Not announced. Rockstar's history (GTA V and RDR2 reached PC one to two years after consoles) fuels expectations of a future port, but that's speculation — not confirmation.",
    "vi.vi-faq-price.q": "How much does it cost?",
    "vi.vi-faq-price.a": "Standard Edition at US$79.99 and Ultimate Edition at US$99.99. In the Brazilian pre-order, stores listed R$449.90 and R$549.90, respectively.",
    "vi.vi-faq-preorder.q": "What do I get for pre-ordering?",
    "vi.vi-faq-preorder.a": "The Vintage Vice City Pack: a retro outfit for Jason, a Vice City era outfit for Lucia, the classic '55 Vapid Stanier sedan and a weapon livery inspired by Tommy Vercetti's shirt. Valid for any edition confirmed by 11/19/2026.",
    "vi.vi-faq-editions.q": "What does the Ultimate Edition add?",
    "vi.vi-faq-editions.a": "Two exclusive missions (the PTT Youngin$ raid and Wyman's project cars), five exclusive shops, vehicles like the '95 Grotti Cheetah and the '67 Vapid Dominator Buggy, plus engraved revolvers from the Vercetti Estate and a palm-print weapon livery.",
    "vi.vi-faq-protagonists.q": "Who are the protagonists?",
    "vi.vi-faq-protagonists.a": "Jason Duval and Lucia Caminos, a Bonnie & Clyde-style criminal duo. Lucia is the first female lead in a mainline GTA since the series' 2D era.",
    "vi.vi-faq-setting.q": "Where is the game set?",
    "vi.vi-faq-setting.a": "In the state of Leonida, the GTA universe's Florida. Vice City is the central metropolis, surrounded by Leonida Keys, Grassrivers, Port Gellhorn, Ambrosia and Mount Kalaga National Park.",
    "vi.vi-faq-map.q": "How big is the map?",
    "vi.vi-faq-map.a": "Rockstar hasn't released numbers. Fan estimates based on the trailers point to the biggest map in the series, but that remains unofficial.",
    "vi.vi-faq-online.q": "What about the online mode?",
    "vi.vi-faq-online.a": "Nothing has been announced about GTA VI's online component. The current GTA Online keeps running inside GTA V.",
    "vi.vi-faq-trailer3.q": "When is Trailer 3 coming?",
    "vi.vi-faq-trailer3.a": "No official date. As of July 2026, the press projects a debut between late July and mid-August, based on updates to Rockstar's site — treat it as rumor.",
    "vi.vi-faq-canon.q": "Do I need to play the earlier GTAs first?",
    "vi.vi-faq-canon.a": "No. GTA VI is part of the HD Universe (the same as GTA IV and V), but tells a standalone story with new characters and a new city.",
    /* ---------- egg: UI ---------- */
